      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/WJGBalderama/status/1983548510218891378",
      "text": "***BEWARE***\n\nA media forum calling itself “OPTICS Politics” has been flooding various platforms with content that defies reason and common sense. My doubts began when it published pieces portraying Rodrigo Duterte as a “prisoner of conscience” and Orly Guteza as a credible witness, despite the glaring inconsistencies and fraudulent nature of his testimony. It even went so far as to brand Martin Romualdez “guilty” based solely on unverified claims from DDS circles.\n\nAfter closer examination and thorough research, I discovered that ‘OPTICS Politics’ isn’t a registered media or news organization — not in the same league as legitimate outlets like CNN, Manila Standard, Fox News, or Manila Times. In truth, it’s nothing more than a propaganda forum used by DDS supporters to peddle distorted narratives, sow confusion, and keep the Duterte myth alive.\n\nOPTICS Politics\n\n***BEWARE***",
